An adversarial-response design: theft is inferred from a weighted signal matrix (owner BLE/voice absence, GPS/WiFi movement, changed SSID, failed owner auth, and a gait signature learned from the owner's IMU carry pattern over 30 days), crossing score thresholds for Theft Suspected/Confirmed, then resisting without alerting the thief, beaconing the owner, and protecting or returning the droid. Authored by Orin in Mar 2026 with a GPS/WiFi triangulation layer added by Aster; no implementation followed.

